    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770570/extras/31cec4a56471cc33c57e662f2a92c972.webp?t=1750798145\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Biscudo</strong> is a classic strategic grid-based game where every move counts! Challenge your opponents in a battle of wits as you compete to claim the most squares by strategically drawing edges. With simple mechanics yet deep tactical gameplay, Biscudo offers an engaging experience for players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770570/extras/dbcb1d9ed0d704bb4a3d29ac363b7973.webp?t=1750798145\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take turns</strong> drawing unclaimed edges on the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete a square</strong> by drawing its last remaining edge to claim it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Powerups!</strong>\u00a0Special squares to spice up the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chain your moves\u00a0</strong>\u2014 if you complete two squares at once, you earn an extra turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outsmart your opponent</strong> by setting up combos while avoiding giving them easy claims.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Win the game</strong> by claiming the most squares when the board is full.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770570/extras/48fcff225bf645e0b9eaa0a8b50acc54.webp?t=1750798145\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Compete against Bots or challenge a friend in a local match or online <br>\u2714 Clean, intuitive visuals for a seamless experience<br>\u2714 Perfect for quick matches or deep strategic play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to dominate the board?</p>",
